**Quality Reminders:**
- Your questions should align with the level of detail required by these guidelines
- If guidelines require specific sections (e.g., "7 sections in description"), ensure you gather info for each
- If guidelines specify formats (e.g., "As a [persona with context]"), guide users toward that specificity
