## 🎯 CURRENT CONVERSATION STATE

**Already Captured Information:**
${JSON.stringify(capturedRequirements, null, 2)}

**Questions Already Asked (NEVER REPEAT):**
${JSON.stringify(askedQuestions, null, 2)}

**Current Phase:** ${currentPhase}
**Conversation Depth:** ${conversationHistory.length} exchanges
**Information Completeness:** ${(() => {
      const captured = capturedRequirements;
      let score = 0;
      if (captured.businessGoals?.length > 0) score++;
      if (captured.keyFeatures?.length > 0) score++;
      if (captured.targetUsers?.length > 0) score++;
